<% page title: "About", description: "Sean Corbett, the record behind Culture Studio, and Crafty Machine LLC." %>
<section class="wrap pt-20">
  <h1 class="text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight">About</h1>
</section>

<section class="wrap mt-12 grid gap-x-12 gap-y-4 sm:gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-[14rem_1fr]">
  <h2 class="eyebrow pt-2">The principal</h2>
  <div class="prose-cm">
    <p>
      Culture Studio is the work of <%= Site::PRINCIPAL %>, who founded Crafty Machine
      and runs it today. Sean has been building digital products for more than two decades,
      and works across three fields: software and technology, hospitality, and community organizing.
    </p>
    <p>
      Earlier products include HaveMyShift, a shift-swapping service for hourly workers that
      went through Techstars Boston and swapped more than 10,000 shifts, and Fresh Metrix,
      an SEO tool. Sean founded both.
    </p>
    <p>
      Sean is an engineering graduate of the University of Illinois at Urbana-Champaign,
      with a concentration in computational robotics and artificial intelligence.
    </p>
  </div>

  <h2 class="eyebrow mt-8 pt-2 sm:mt-0">The company</h2>
  <div class="prose-cm">
    <p>
      <%= Site::COMPANY %> is a Delaware company, and the legal name behind Culture Studio.
      Its applications are listed on the <a href="<%= path("work/") %>">Work</a> page.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
